  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your connection to this divine domain ensures you always have certain spells ready. When you reach a Cleric level specified in the Life Domain Spells table, you thereafter always have the listed spells prepared.</p><table><caption><p>Life Domain Spells</p></caption><thead><tr><td><p>Cleric Level</p></td><td><p>Prepared Spells</p></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.spells.Item.phbsplAid0000000]{Aid}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.spells.Item.phbsplBless00000]{Bless}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.spells.Item.phbsplCureWounds]{Cure Wounds},<br>@UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.spells.Item.phbsplLesserRest]{Lesser Restoration}</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.spells.Item.phbsplMassHealin]{Mass Healing Word}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.spells.Item.phbsplRevivify00]{Revivify}</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>7</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.spells.Item.phbsplAuraofLife]{Aura of Life}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.spells.Item.phbsplDeathWard0]{Death Ward}</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>9</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.spells.Item.phbsplGreaterRes]{Greater Restoration}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.spells.Item.phbsplMassCureWo]{Mass Cure Wounds}</p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
